  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "world",
      "type": "wiki",
      "title": "世界观常识",
      "icon": "📘",
      "intro": "概念学的基础知识：概念、行者、印记、念与阶级。",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "conceptology",
          "title": "概念学",
          "subtitle": "Conceptology",
          "summary": "**概念学**是《理想乡》的世界观基础。世界上常见的抽象概念——愤怒、自由、命运——都是拥有意志的存在，被称为**概念**。与概念交易、获得力量的人类被称为[[行者]]。",
          "spoiler": 0,
          "sections": [
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "title": "概念",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "概念的存在依靠意识体的定义。\n该存在是概念性的，例如人群的混乱和电子云的混乱皆为[[混乱]]。它们的力量来源于||造物主的意识，晶石||，通过[[晶石]]||对造物主的领域进行修改和扭曲||来获得力量\n\n在[[前文明]]中，概念没有直接干预世界的能力，但它们的对意识体的侵蚀和腐蚀能力大大提高。||造物主为了研究概念并尝试解决它们的侵蚀，创造出领域【梦中净土】和心之境【众愿净土】用来研究它们的特性。||\n\n在造物纪开始后，概念获得了干预世界的力量。它们的力量会根据意识体的认知和造物主的认知发生扭曲和变形，以不同形态的方式干预：火焰，闪电，岩石，风，影子，光，植物，等等等等...\n因此，同一个概念可能在不同的人手中以不同形态的方式爆发力量。\n\n概念会随着意识体的定义逐渐扭曲分裂，而过于小的概念无法吞噬[[晶石]]，导致无法成为有一定意识的概念。\n概念的意识来自于||造物主的意识||，部分概念会在拥有意识后变强，也有部分需要维持一定程度的有意识和无意识，以至于部分保持无意识才能使用全部权能（三种例子分别是：混乱，审判和命运）。\n\n",
              "title_en": "Concepts",
              "body_en": "Concepts are the warped essence of the world. Think of them as the little sprites from childhood fairy tales: some are friendly, some deeply hostile to humans.\n\n> A concept has — and must have — two sides. That is an unchanging law.\n\nFor example, 【Extreme Calm】 and 【Extreme Rage】 both belong to [[Extremity]]."
            },
            {
              "id": "s2",
              "title": "行者与共鸣印记",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "概念与行者之间是**交易关系**：概念给予力量和奖励，行者付出代价。\n\n每位行者身上都有一种印记，既代表他们是被概念选中的人，也代表有概念与他们做了交易。这种印记被称为**【共鸣印记】**。\n\n- 印记无法去除或隐藏，但可以被衣服遮住\n- 越强的行者，印记覆盖的范围越大\n- 印记的作用是让人承受力量，就像撑住高楼大厦的地基",
              "title_en": "Walkers and Resonance Marks",
              "body_en": "Concepts and Walkers have a **transactional relationship**: the concept grants power and rewards, and the Walker pays a price.\n\nEvery Walker bears a mark that shows they were chosen by a concept and that a deal was made. It is called a **【Resonance Mark】**.\n\n- A Mark cannot be removed or hidden, though clothing can cover it\n- The stronger the Walker, the larger the Mark\n- The Mark lets a body bear the power, like the foundation under a skyscraper"
            },
            {
              "id": "s3",
              "title": "概念化与傀儡",
              "level": 3,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "如果力量变强但印记没有变大，行者就会陷入危险，很有可能**概念化**。概念化是不可逆转的，他们都会变成概念的**傀儡**。",
              "title_en": "Conceptualization and Puppets",
              "body_en": "If the power grows but the Mark does not, the Walker is in danger of **conceptualization**. It is irreversible: they all become the concept’s **puppets**."
            },
            {
              "id": "s4",
              "title": "念",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "说好听点叫念力，说不好听点就是**注意力**。行者靠念捕捉震动、气味、温度、呼吸声等一切信息。",
              "title_en": "Nen",
              "body_en": "Put nicely, it is psychic power; put bluntly, it is **attention**. Walkers use Nen to pick up vibrations, smells, temperature, breathing — every scrap of information."
            },
            {
              "id": "s5",
              "title": "阶级",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "行者的等级按概念对身体所修改的程度，也就是**身体基础强度**来划分，而不是能力本身的强度。\n\n- **三阶**：可以做到导弹级别的攻击，接近音速甚至超音速移动\n- **四阶**：[[序列]]所在的阶级",
              "title_en": "Tiers",
              "body_en": "A Walker’s Tier is set by how much the concept has altered their body — their **base physical strength** — not by how strong the ability itself is.\n\n- **Tier Three**: missile-level attacks; near-sonic or supersonic movement\n- **Tier Four**: the Tier of the [[Sequence|Sequences]]"
            }
          ],
          "title_en": "Conceptology",
          "summary_en": "**Conceptology** is the foundation of ARCADIA’s world. Everyday abstract ideas — anger, freedom, fate — are beings with wills of their own, called **Concepts**. Humans who strike deals with them and gain power are called [[Walker|Walkers]]."
        },
        {
          "id": "eras",
          "title": "三大纪元",
          "summary": "根据史书《造物纪全篇》《救世纪全篇》和《共鸣纪●始》，世界历史分为三个纪元。时间线见[事件模块](#/m/events)。",
          "spoiler": 0,
          "sections": [
            {
              "id": "e1",
              "title": "造物纪",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "[[造物主]]创造了万物，并发现了概念，对概念进行了深度的实验。随后灾难降临，概念开始入侵现实，造物主因此陨落。",
              "title_en": "Era of Creation",
              "body_en": "[[The Creator]] made all things and discovered the concepts, experimenting on them deeply. Then disaster struck: concepts began invading reality, and the Creator fell."
            },
            {
              "id": "e2",
              "title": "救世纪",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "一位名为[[救世主]]的人与概念抗衡，最终以陷入疯狂为代价，换回了世界的一丝生存的可能性。",
              "title_en": "Era of Salvation",
              "body_en": "A man called [[The Savior]] stood against the concepts. In the end, at the cost of his sanity, he won back a sliver of hope for the world."
            },
            {
              "id": "e3",
              "title": "共鸣纪",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "辉煌的共鸣纪，也就是现在。[[共鸣主]]与概念立下契约，共鸣印记便这样诞生了。",
              "title_en": "Era of Resonance",
              "body_en": "The glorious Era of Resonance — the present. [[The Resonator]] made a pact with the concepts, and Resonance Marks were born."
            }
          ],
          "title_en": "The Three Eras",
          "summary_en": "According to the Chronicles — *The Era of Creation: Complete*, *The Era of Salvation: Complete* and *The Era of Resonance●Genesis* — history is divided into three eras. See the [timeline](#/m/events)."
        },
        {
          "id": "phbvr19",
          "title": "至高伦",
          "title_en": "Supreme Hierarchy",
          "summary": "",
          "spoiler": 0,
          "sections": [
            {
              "id": "sblragg",
              "title": "至高伦",
              "title_en": "Supreme Hierarchy",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "至高由共鸣主在救世主晚期所观察的数据中第一出来的，比概念更接近法则本体的法则的化身\n祂们不吞噬任何意识，也没有任何的意识。祂们不回应也无法回应任何存在，因为祂们只是法则本身。",
              "body_en": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "s96jdrt",
              "title": "[[世界]]",
              "title_en": "",
              "level": 2,
              "spoiler": 0,
              "body": "顾名思义，即世界本身。祂被称为原初的那一位，【神】，但祂本身并不会为任何存在带来任何的馈赠或保佑。\n\n祂以身体化作世界，而增熵就是祂尸体的腐烂。身为一切存在的第一因，没有存在祂创造世界的理由是什么，但也没有必要了。",
              "body_en": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "title_en": "World Basics",
      "intro_en": "The basics of Conceptology: concepts, Walkers, Marks, Nen and Tiers."
    },
